{"id":"67790f1308175de1","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-thm-cummings.md","title":"Core Model Existence Below a Woodin Cardinal","display":"thm-cummings — Core Model Existence Below a Woodin Cardinal","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-cummings","aliases":["58-thm-cummings"],"display":"thm-cummings — Core Model Existence Below a Woodin Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-thm-core-model]]","[[58-df-core-model-k]]","[[58-df-woodin]]","[[58-df-constructible-universe]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-cummings"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-cummings</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cummings — Core Model Existence Below a Woodin Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"baa9f2ada6bcef62\" href=\"?note=baa9f2ada6bcef62\" title=\"58-thm-core-model\">58-thm-core-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f8f3c414525dd904\" href=\"?note=f8f3c414525dd904\" title=\"58-df-core-model-k\">58-df-core-model-k</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"da3159c0c219916e\" href=\"?note=da3159c0c219916e\" title=\"58-df-woodin\">58-df-woodin</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"58-df-constructible-universe\">58-df-constructible-universe</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,N\">\\(K,N\\)</span> (metalinguistic inner-class variables)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}\\)</span> (metalinguistic domain of class quantification) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Woodin}\">\\(\\mathrm{Woodin}\\)</span> (class-internal Woodin formula)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> (Woodin-cardinal candidate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"da3159c0c219916e\" href=\"?note=da3159c0c219916e\" title=\"58-df-woodin\">58-df-woodin</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CoreModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}},\\mathrm{InnerModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}},\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{CoreModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}},\\mathrm{InnerModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}},\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (class-level metatheoretic predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathrm{GCH}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathrm{GCH}\\)</span> (background theory and generalized continuum hypothesis)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cummings}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\neg\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}N\\;\\exists\\delta\\;\\left(\\mathrm{InnerModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(N)\\land N\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\right)\\to\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}K\\;\\left(\\mathrm{CoreModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(K)\\land\\mathrm{InnerModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(K)\\land K\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\mathrm{GCH}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cummings}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\neg\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}N\\;\\exists\\delta\\;\\left(\\mathrm{InnerModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(N)\\land N\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\right)\\to\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}K\\;\\left(\\mathrm{CoreModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(K)\\land\\mathrm{InnerModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(K)\\land K\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\mathrm{GCH}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom records the core-model theorem in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"baa9f2ada6bcef62\" href=\"?note=baa9f2ada6bcef62\" title=\"58-thm-core-model\">58-thm-core-model</a>; it does not claim that all inner models below a strong cardinal form a uniquely selected set.</li>\n<li>The hypothesis excludes an inner model with a Woodin cardinal, not merely a Woodin cardinal of the ambient universe. Proper inner models and their truth predicates are therefore stated at the metalevel rather than passed to the set-coded satisfaction relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-thm-core-model","status":"resolved","id":"baa9f2ada6bcef62","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-core-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-core-model-k","status":"resolved","id":"f8f3c414525dd904","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-core-model-k]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-woodin","status":"resolved","id":"da3159c0c219916e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-woodin]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-constructible-universe","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-constructible-universe]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-woodin","status":"resolved","id":"da3159c0c219916e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\delta$ (Woodin-cardinal candidate, see [[58-df-woodin]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-core-model","status":"resolved","id":"baa9f2ada6bcef62","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"This atom records the core-model theorem in [[58-thm-core-model]]; it does not claim that all inner models below a strong cardinal form a uniquely selected set.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Woodin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CoreModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}},\\mathrm{InnerModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}},\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathrm{GCH}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cummings}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\neg\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}N\\;\\exists\\delta\\;\\left(\\mathrm{InnerModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(N)\\land N\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\right)\\to\\exists_{\\mathrm{Class}}K\\;\\left(\\mathrm{CoreModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(K)\\land\\mathrm{InnerModel}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(K)\\land K\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\mathrm{GCH}\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1707,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-thm-cummings.md|58-thm-cummings]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["baa9f2ada6bcef62","f8f3c414525dd904","da3159c0c219916e","de47935b5769dd1e"]}